.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-gitea-git-tree 1  "geectl-gitea-git-tree 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-git\-tree \- Show the recursive tree of a repository at a commit: the paths, modes, types, and blob SHAs, flattened. A tree larger than one page (1000 entries) is an error, never a partial list
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea git\-tree\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOWNER\fR> <\fIREPO\fR> <\fISHA\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the recursive tree of a repository at a commit: the paths, modes, types, and blob SHAs, flattened. A tree larger than one page (1000 entries) is an error, never a partial list
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOWNER\fR>
The repository owner
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>
The repository name
.TP
<\fISHA\fR>
The commit or tree SHA
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
